{"nodes": [{"id": "_specify_extensions_git_commands_speckit_git_commit_auto_commit_command", "label": "speckit.git.commit \u2014 Auto-Commit Changes", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".specify/extensions/git/commands/speckit.git.commit.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_specify_extensions_git_commands_speckit_git_commit_commit_style", "label": "commit_style: fixed / conventional / snapshot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".specify/extensions/git/commands/speckit.git.commit.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_specify_extensions_git_commands_speckit_git_commit_conventional_commit_message", "label": "Conventional Commit message generated from the diff", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/extensions/git/commands/speckit.git.commit.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The generated message is derived from repository changes and may contain characters a shell would execute or that break command quoting, so it is written to a temporary file and passed via --message-file / -MessageFile instead of being interpolated into a shell command string."}, {"id": "_specify_extensions_git_commands_speckit_git_commit_snapshot_rollback", "label": "Snapshot rollback commit (before_* hooks)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/extensions/git/commands/speckit.git.commit.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "before_* hooks freeze the state the previous phase left so a phase can be rolled back; the frozen phase is classified from the staged diff (never from hook order, since /analyze and /checklist may run in either order); the last phase of a branch deliberately gets no snapshot \u2014 it closes with a PR/merge."},